<title>MEXICO: Mexico TIIE 28-day rate rises to 26.50 pct.</title>
<headline>Mexico TIIE 28-day rate rises to 26.50 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's 28-day interbank interest rate rose to 26.50 percent Monday from Friday's rate of 26.35 percent, Mexican Stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>The TIIE is a market-weighted average interbank rate.</p>
<p>--Mexico City newsroom (525) 728-9558</p>
</text>
